        "content": [
          "To start the process for ACME,",
          "begin with the New Resupply Cycle",
          "then Check Levels of Inventory.",
          "If the inventory is below or equal to the minimum, generate an Equal to or below minimum Report.",
          "If the report indicates that the inventory is equal to or below the minimum, create Purchase Orders (POs).",
          "If the PO is created, it needs to be reviewed.",
          "If the PO is approved, it is printed and released in the system.",
          "Simultaneously, reserve funds for the released POs and mail the POs to the supplier.",
          "If funds are reserved for the released POs, receive the Packing Slip.",
          "If the Packing Slip is received, proceed to receive the Invoice.",
          "If the Invoice is received, proceed to the Three-way match.",
          "If the Three-way match is successful, release the funds.",
          "Once the funds are released, issue the payment.",
          "After the payment is issued, the Resupply Cycle is complete and the process ends."
        ]
      },
